  <!-- ============ 右侧栏 ============ -->
  <aside class="rightbar">
    <!-- 提交任务 -->
    <section class="card" id="submit-card">
      <div class="card-head"><h2>提交突变计算任务</h2></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <form id="task-form">
          <label class="field"><span>蛋白复合物结构 (.pdb)</span>
            <input type="file" id="pdb-input" accept=".pdb" required/>
            <small id="pdb-name" class="dim">未选择文件</small>
          </label>
          <label class="field"><span>配体文件 <small>(可选, .pdb/.mol2，不传则自动分离)</small></span>
            <input type="file" id="ligand-input" accept=".pdb,.mol2"/>
            <small id="ligand-name" class="dim">未选择文件</small>
          </label>
          <label class="field"><span>目标突变位点 <small>(PDB 晶体学编号，多位点逗号分隔)</small></span>
            <input type="text" id="mutation" placeholder="例如: 76,73" required/></label>
          <label class="field"><span>高级参数（可选）</span>
            <input type="text" id="params" placeholder="例如: 并发数 48, 延迟 1.5"/></label>
          <label class="field"><span>附加指令（可选）</span>
            <textarea id="msg" rows="2" placeholder="例如：优先关注口袋周围 6Å 内位点"></textarea></label>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-start" id="submit-btn"><span class="btn-label">开始突变计算</span><span class="btn-spin" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <p class="tiny-dim">弛豫与饱和突变在后台多核运行，可关闭页面稍后在历史任务中下载结果</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Agent 执行对话 -->
    <section class="card" id="chat-card">
      <div class="card-head chat-head">
        <h2>Agent 执行对话</h2>
        <span class="chat-status mono" id="chat-status">待命</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-body" id="thread">
        <p class="chat-empty">在左侧提交任务后，智能体的每一步执行情况将在此实时显示；任务完成后可直接在下方输入框继续对话（核对编号、追加位点、重跑某一步）。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="composer">
        <input type="text" id="follow-input" placeholder="任务完成后可继续对话，例如：再算一下 105 号位点" disabled/>
        <button id="follow-btn" class="btn-send" disabled>发送</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </aside>
